# TrailBase Ops

Use `skills/trailbase-ops/SKILL.md` as the canonical guide. Load
`skills/trailbase-ops/references/trailbase-ops.md` for detailed migration,
Record API, deployment, and mTLS proxy guardrails.

- Do not rewrite baseline SQL when production-like data may exist.
- Prefer additive, forward-only TrailBase migrations.
- Verify `config.textproto` changes alongside schema changes.
- Check Rust WASM with the repo's `wasm32-wasip2` command.
- Keep mTLS certificates in the proxy container only.
